 "sentences": [
  {
   "scene": "hook1",
   "text": "A car loan with twenty-five thousand dollars left, at five point two percent.",
   "words": 13,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.73,
   "wpm": 164.9,
   "tempo": 0.8969
  },
  {
   "scene": "hook2",
   "text": "Pay it off early, or invest the extra cash?",
   "words": 9,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.25,
   "wpm": 166.2,
   "tempo": 0.825
  },
  {
   "scene": "hook3",
   "text": "We ran both roads through all forty-eight months, taxing every lot.",
   "words": 11,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.08,
   "wpm": 161.8,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "hook4",
   "text": "The answer flips at an average annual return of six point one one percent, compounded, in the twenty-two percent tax bracket.",
   "words": 21,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 7.61,
   "wpm": 165.6,
   "tempo": 0.8617
  },
  {
   "scene": "hook5",
   "text": "Below it, paying off ends ahead.",
   "words": 6,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 2.18,
   "wpm": 165.1,
   "tempo": 0.9717
  },
  {
   "scene": "hook5",
   "text": "Above it, investing does.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 2.503,
   "seconds": 1.83,
   "wpm": 131.1,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "scope1",
   "text": "Here is the setup: the rules are U.S. tax rules, and every input is stated, not forecast.",
   "words": 17,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 6.18,
   "wpm": 165,
   "tempo": 0.9544
  },
  {
   "scene": "scope2",
   "text": "Loan interest is treated as not deductible, so the model ignores the new-car loan interest deduction for twenty twenty-five to twenty twenty-eight.",
   "words": 22,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 8,
   "wpm": 165,
   "tempo": 0.9512
  },
  {
   "scene": "facts",
   "text": "The loan has twenty-five thousand dollars left at five point two percent, with forty-eight monthly payments of five hundred seventy-eight dollars.",
   "words": 21,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 7.64,
   "wpm": 164.9,
   "tempo": 0.9861
  },
  {
   "scene": "extra",
   "text": "On top of that, four hundred dollars a month is available.",
   "words": 11,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.84,
   "wpm": 171.9,
   "tempo": 0.75
  },
  {
   "scene": "extra",
   "text": "That amount is illustrative.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 4.14,
   "seconds": 1.46,
   "wpm": 164.4,
   "tempo": 0.9144
  },
  {
   "scene": "roads",
   "text": "Road A sends it to the loan.",
   "words": 7,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 2.54,
   "wpm": 165.4,
   "tempo": 0.7504
  },
  {
   "scene": "roads",
   "text": "Road B pays the minimum and invests it every month.",
   "words": 10,
   "start": 2.885,
   "seconds": 3.64,
   "wpm": 164.8,
   "tempo": 0.869
  },
  {
   "scene": "cash",
   "text": "Both roads spend the same cash each month.",
   "words": 8,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 2.95,
   "wpm": 162.7,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "cash",
   "text": "Only the order changes.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 3.27,
   "seconds": 1.49,
   "wpm": 161.1,
   "tempo": 0.825
  },
  {
   "scene": "card1",
   "text": "First, the certain part.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 1.98,
   "wpm": 121.2,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "timeline",
   "text": "Road A pays off the loan at month twenty-eight.",
   "words": 9,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.15,
   "wpm": 171.4,
   "tempo": 0.854
  },
  {
   "scene": "timeline",
   "text": "Road B keeps paying through month forty-eight.",
   "words": 7,
   "start": 3.454,
   "seconds": 2.92,
   "wpm": 143.8,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "free",
   "text": "That leaves twenty months with no car payment on road A.",
   "words": 11,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.45,
   "wpm": 148.3,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "interest",
   "text": "Interest paid falls from two thousand seven hundred forty-four dollars to one thousand five hundred fifty-four dollars.",
   "words": 17,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 6.33,
   "wpm": 161.1,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "avoided",
   "text": "Road A avoids one thousand one hundred ninety dollars of interest.",
   "words": 11,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.11,
   "wpm": 160.6,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "avoided",
   "text": "That does not depend on markets or taxes.",
   "words": 8,
   "start": 4.37,
   "seconds": 2.83,
   "wpm": 169.6,
   "tempo": 0.9007
  },
  {
   "scene": "certain",
   "text": "It is certain.",
   "words": 3,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 1.46,
   "wpm": 123.3,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "identity",
   "text": "Because both roads spend the same cash, road A ends up investing exactly one thousand one hundred ninety dollars more than road B.",
   "words": 23,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 9.16,
   "wpm": 150.7,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "bridge",
   "text": "So the question is narrow: can road B's head start in the market beat a certain one thousand one hundred ninety dollars, after tax?",
   "words": 24,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 8.47,
   "wpm": 170,
   "tempo": 0.8524
  },
  {
   "scene": "card2",
   "text": "Second, tax, lot by lot.",
   "words": 5,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 2.68,
   "wpm": 111.9,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots1",
   "text": "Each month's contribution is its own tax lot.",
   "words": 8,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.05,
   "wpm": 157.4,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots1",
   "text": "At month forty-eight, everything is sold.",
   "words": 6,
   "start": 3.36,
   "seconds": 2.19,
   "wpm": 164.4,
   "tempo": 0.9579
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots2",
   "text": "A lot held more than twelve months at that sale is long-term.",
   "words": 12,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.39,
   "wpm": 164,
   "tempo": 0.8823
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots2",
   "text": "The rest are short-term.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 4.68,
   "seconds": 1.58,
   "wpm": 151.9,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "rates",
   "text": "In the twenty-two percent bracket, long-term gains are taxed at fifteen percent, and short-term gains at the full twenty-two percent.",
   "words": 20,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 7.64,
   "wpm": 157.1,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots3",
   "text": "Road B invests from the start, so thirty-five of its forty-eight lots are long-term.",
   "words": 14,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 5.08,
   "wpm": 165.4,
   "tempo": 0.9664
  },
  {
   "scene": "lots3",
   "text": "Road A starts after the payoff: eight of its twenty-one.",
   "words": 10,
   "start": 5.413,
   "seconds": 3.63,
   "wpm": 165.3,
   "tempo": 0.9762
  },
  {
   "scene": "share",
   "text": "Near the break-even, thirty-seven percent of road A's gains are short-term, against seven percent of road B's.",
   "words": 17,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 6.38,
   "wpm": 159.9,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "nodeduct",
   "text": "A lot that loses money gets no deduction.",
   "words": 8,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 2.86,
   "wpm": 167.8,
   "tempo": 0.75
  },
  {
   "scene": "nodeduct",
   "text": "State income tax is left out.",
   "words": 6,
   "start": 3.207,
   "seconds": 2.08,
   "wpm": 173.1,
   "tempo": 0.75
  },
  {
   "scene": "card3",
   "text": "Third, where the answer flips.",
   "words": 5,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 1.82,
   "wpm": 164.8,
   "tempo": 0.869
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw1",
   "text": "We sweep the average annual return from two percent to ten percent, compounded, in the twenty-two percent bracket.",
   "words": 18,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 6.63,
   "wpm": 162.9,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw2",
   "text": "The line is road B minus road A, net worth after tax at month forty-eight, and it rises with the return.",
   "words": 21,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 7.6,
   "wpm": 165.8,
   "tempo": 0.9376
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw3",
   "text": "At two percent, road A is ahead by eight hundred twenty-two dollars.",
   "words": 12,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.37,
   "wpm": 164.8,
   "tempo": 0.9235
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw3",
   "text": "At ten percent, road B is ahead by eight hundred sixty-one dollars.",
   "words": 12,
   "start": 4.689,
   "seconds": 4.22,
   "wpm": 170.6,
   "tempo": 0.88
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw4",
   "text": "Both roads end even at six point one one percent.",
   "words": 10,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.56,
   "wpm": 168.5,
   "tempo": 0.957
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw5",
   "text": "Below that return, paying off early ends ahead.",
   "words": 8,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 3.81,
   "wpm": 126,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "sw5",
   "text": "Above it, investing does.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 4.13,
   "seconds": 2.18,
   "wpm": 110.1,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "card4",
   "text": "Fourth, the tax bracket.",
   "words": 4,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 1.63,
   "wpm": 147.2,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "niit",
   "text": "In the thirty-two percent bracket we add the three point eight percent net investment income tax: short-term gains pay thirty-five point eight percent, long-term gains eighteen point eight percent.",
   "words": 29,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 11.09,
   "wpm": 156.9,
   "tempo": 0.948
  },
  {
   "scene": "dots",
   "text": "The break-even is five point two three percent in the twelve percent bracket, and six point one one percent in the twenty-two percent bracket.",
   "words": 24,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 9.15,
   "wpm": 157.4,
   "tempo": 0.8327
  },
  {
   "scene": "dots32",
   "text": "In the thirty-two percent bracket, it is six point two six percent.",
   "words": 12,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.6,
   "wpm": 156.5,
   "tempo": 0.8632
  },
  {
   "scene": "rises",
   "text": "Higher rates on gains shrink road B's head start, so the threshold rises with the bracket.",
   "words": 16,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 6.12,
   "wpm": 156.9,
   "tempo": 0.9253
  },
  {
   "scene": "below",
   "text": "In the twelve percent bracket it sits below five point three three percent, the loan rate as an annual yield, because road A's gains are mostly short-term.",
   "words": 27,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 10.33,
   "wpm": 156.8,
   "tempo": 0.8864
  },
  {
   "scene": "card5",
   "text": "Fifth, risk.",
   "words": 2,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 1.09,
   "wpm": 110.1,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "risk1",
   "text": "Paying off the loan earns a certain five point two percent.",
   "words": 11,
   "start": 0,
   "seconds": 4.7,
   "wpm": 140.4,
   "tempo": 1
  },
  {
   "scene": "risk2",
   "text": "Investing earns an average, not a promise.",
